## The system in four lines

| Repo | Role | Port |
|---|---|---|
| Mimir | orchestrator | 8000 |
| Homebase | service | 3000 |
| BudgetTracker | service | 8080 |
| Grimoire | service | 8040 |

**Mimir is the only client. The services never call each other.** Cross-service
orchestration lives in Mimir. Each service owns its data exclusively — no service
reads another's storage, ever.

