## This repo

### Role in the household system

Homebase is the household operations source of truth for Mimir: inventory, shopping
lists, tasks, recipes (via MCP). The app itself is broader — see the guide below.

- For Mimir-facing work, prefer inventory and shopping list first.
- Keep the MCP layer thin. All logic lives in the domain layer so the web UI and
  MCP drive the same code. Business logic in a tool handler is a bug.
- Tools you are not implementing this session stay `status: planned` in the
  contract. Do not mark something `implemented` because the handler exists.

